ID  - 42977258
TI  - Discovery, optimization, and Phase 1 evaluation of a novel, orally available GLP-1R/GIPR dual agonist.
AU  - Mowery Stephanie A
AU  - Knerr Patrick J
AU  - Hjøllund Karina Rahr
AU  - Nissen Birgitte
AU  - Olsen Anette K
