TI  - Efficacy and safety of mazdutide in adults with obesity or overweight: a US-based, multicentre, phase 2, randomised, placebo-controlled clinical trial.
AU  - Hsia Stanley H
AU  - Bays Harold E
AU  - Billings Liana K
AU  - Weideman Ann Marie K
AU  - Mather Kieren J
AU  - Coskun Tamer
