TI  - Clinical efficacy of switching to tirzepatide in patients with type 2 diabetes and a high risk of metabolic dysfunction-associated steatotic liver disease undergoing GLP-1 receptor agonist therapy: Insights from the Hokkaido-TZP study.
AU  - Takiyama Takao
